OL,3,GNEWSA'I turned my Citreon 2CV into a DJ
OL,4,Abooth'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the classic car once used by
OL,7,FFrench farmers and country folk as a
OL,8,Fcheap, robust way to get around.
OL,10,FBut businessman Andrew Teverson's
OL,11,FCitroen 2CV doesn't just get him from A
OL,12,Fto B - he's also turned it into a DJ
OL,13,FBooth.
OL,15,FThe 41-year-old from Halesowen drives
OL,16,Fthe 1948 classic every day but it has
OL,17,Falso been used for events at university
OL,18,Fstudent unions and shopping centres.
OL,20,F"People think it is great what we have
OL,21,Fdone," he said. "It is still driveable
OL,22,Fand useable."
